  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Upgrade DV:</strong> DV21</p>\n<p><strong>Total Material Cost:</strong> Cost of item being upgraded + 500eb</p>\n<p><em>Everyone knows this tech — lob parts off so it fits under a coat. Issue is, corps use ‘proprietary’ designs, so doing it correctly is a bit tricky.</em></p>\n<p>Invented Tech Upgrade. Must be installed in a Non-Concealable, Non-Explosive Two-Handed Ranged Weapon that is not a Bow. The weapon can now be Concealed, but all Attack Checks with it suffer a -2 penalty, or a -4 penalty if the target is beyond 50m/yds, and all BODY requirements it and its functions have (if any) are increased by 3. This does not overwrite Attachments that render the weapon Non-Concealable (e.g., Extended Magazine, Foregrip, etc), but does overwrite Weapon Mods that do so (e.g., Conversion Kits, Upsized Power, etc).</p>\n<p><strong>Invented Tech Upgrade:</strong> Upgrade DV21; total material cost: the item's cost + 500eb</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Price is 0 because a Tech builds this; the material cost depends on the item upgraded.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Mod Catalog &gt; Invented Weapon Upgrades).</em></p>"
